{"id": "ce1cd89f-08d5-4a98-a252-fc7c1d171e9c", "slug": "aura-connect-interface-1", "title": "Aura Connect Interface", "description": "Connect Interface UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Aura Connect Interface\"\ndescription: \"Connect Interface UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#050505\"\n  secondary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  accent: \"#050505\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aura Connect Interface\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 5; favorites: 0; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, legal, links, support.\n## Overview\nConnect Interface UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nStart your path to deeper insight. Uncover patterns, track your routines, and enhance your daily wellbeing through beautifully designed, frictionless tools built for modern living. Direct Line +1 (415) 555 0198 Electron…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Start your path to deeper insight.; Aura..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #050505, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #050505, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aura Connect Interface</title>\n\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-zinc-100 relative overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen flex flex-col pt-24 pb-8 sm:pb-12\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #050505;\">\n\n    <!-- Brighter Wisps (CSS Blobs) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[50vw] h-[50vw] bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none z-[-3]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[50vw] h-[50vw] bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none z-[-3]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-[40%] left-[60%] w-[30vw] h-[30vw] bg-amber-400/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none z-[-3]\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Canvas Particle Background (Brighter) -->\n    <canvas id=\"canvas-particles\" class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-[-2] opacity-[0.45]\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Vertical Container Lines with Mini Squares -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-[-1] flex justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[85rem] h-full relative px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"h-full w-px bg-white/[0.04] relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-3/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-full w-px bg-white/[0.04] relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-3/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[85rem] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 mt-auto\">\n\n        <!-- Outer wrapper for gradient border -->\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-[2rem] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/[0.02] to-transparent shadow-2xl shadow-black\">\n\n            <!-- Remixed Grid Layout -->\n            <div class=\"bg-zinc-900 overflow-hidden rounded-[calc(2rem-1px)] grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-[1px]\">\n\n                <!-- Top Left: Intro Text -->\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-14 flex flex-col justify-center h-full relative\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/5 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight mb-6 text-white leading-tight reveal-target\">Start your path to deeper insight.</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-md reveal-target\">Uncover patterns, track your routines, and enhance your daily wellbeing through beautifully designed, frictionless tools built for modern living.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Top Right: Contact Info & Address -->\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-14 flex flex-col justify-center h-full relative group\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/5 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-10 sm:gap-6 relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"space-y-10\">\n                            <div>\n                                <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-light mb-3 block reveal-target\">Direct Line</span>\n                                <div class=\"inline-block group/link cursor-pointer\">\n                                    <a href=\"tel:+14155550198\" class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white reveal-target block pb-1\">\n                                        +1 (415) 555 0198\n                                    </a>\n                                    <div class=\"h-[2px] w-full bg-amber-500 scale-x-0 group-hover/link:scale-x-100 transition-transform origin-left duration-300 ease-out\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div>\n                                <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-light mb-3 block reveal-target\">Electronic Mail</span>\n                                <div class=\"inline-block group/link cursor-pointer\">\n                                    <a href=\"mailto:hello@aura.design\" class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-normal text-white reveal-target block pb-1\">\n                                        hello@aura.design\n                                    </a>\n                                    <div class=\"h-[2px] w-full bg-amber-500 scale-x-0 group-hover/link:scale-x-100 transition-transform origin-left duration-300 ease-out\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-start\">\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-light mb-4 block reveal-target\">Headquarters</span>\n                            <address class=\"not-italic text-base sm:text-lg text-white font-normal leading-relaxed tracking-tight space-y-1\">\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\">Aura Design Studio</div>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target text-zinc-400\">840 Visionary Way</div>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target text-zinc-400\">San Francisco, CA 94107</div>\n                            </address>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Middle Full Width: Links Grid with Icons -->\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-14 col-span-1 lg:col-span-2 relative\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/5 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-12\">\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-4 sm:space-y-5\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-point-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 min-w-[20px]\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors block\">System Architecture</a></div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:book-bookmark-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 min-w-[20px]\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors block\">Core Philosophy</a></div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 min-w-[20px]\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors block\">Feature Set</a></div>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-4 sm:space-y-5\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chat-round-like-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 min-w-[20px]\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors block\">User Stories</a></div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pen-new-square-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 min-w-[20px]\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors block\">Daily Reflections</a></div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:question-circle-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 min-w-[20px]\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors block\">Assistance & Guides</a></div>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-4 sm:space-y-5\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 min-w-[20px]\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors block\">Data Protection</a></div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 min-w-[20px]\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors block\">Legal Terms</a></div>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-4 sm:space-y-5\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 min-w-[20px]\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors block\">Tracking Preferences</a></div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:accessibility-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-600 min-w-[20px]\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"reveal-target\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors block\">Inclusive Design</a></div>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Left: Social Buttons -->\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-14 relative flex items-center justify-start min-h-[12rem] lg:min-h-[14rem]\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/5 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-amber-400 bg-amber-500 text-zinc-950 border border-amber-700/20 shadow-sm\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:camera-linear\" width=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-amber-400 bg-amber-500 text-zinc-950 border border-amber-700/20 shadow-sm\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:slash-square-linear\" width=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-amber-400 bg-amber-500 text-zinc-950 border border-amber-700/20 shadow-sm\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-rounded-linear\" width=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Right: Brand & Copyright -->\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 sm:p-12 lg:px-14 flex flex-col justify-end items-end relative min-h-[12rem] lg:min-h-[14rem]\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/5 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto w-full flex items-end justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"text-zinc-500 font-normal text-xs sm:text-sm relative z-10 pb-1.5 brand-year opacity-0 tracking-widest uppercase\">\n                            ©2027\n                        </div>\n\n                        <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white flex overflow-hidden\">\n                            <span class=\"brand-reveal translate-y-full inline-block\">Aura.</span>\n                        </h1>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Text Splitting & Masked Reveal Setup (using inline styles to avoid <style> tags)\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-target');\n\n            revealElements.forEach((el) => {\n                const content = el.innerText;\n                const isLink = el.tagName === 'A' || el.querySelector('a');\n\n                if (isLink && el.tagName === 'A') {\n                    splitTextIntoSpans(el, content);\n                } else if (!isLink) {\n                    el.innerHTML = '';\n                    splitTextIntoSpans(el, content);\n                }\n            });\n\n            function splitTextIntoSpans(parent, text) {\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                parent.innerHTML = '';\n                words.forEach((word, index) => {\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n                    wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                    wrapper.style.marginRight = index < words.length - 1 ? '0.25em' : '0';\n\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'reveal-inner';\n                    inner.textContent = word;\n                    inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    inner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    parent.appendChild(wrapper);\n                });\n            }\n\n            // 2. GSAP Animations\n            revealElements.forEach((el) => {\n                const inners = el.querySelectorAll('.reveal-inner');\n                if (inners.length > 0) {\n                    gsap.to(inners, {\n                        y: '0%',\n                        ease: \"power4.out\",\n                        duration: 1,\n                        stagger: 0.04,\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: el,\n                            start: \"top 95%\",\n                        }\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n\n            gsap.to('.brand-reveal', {\n                y: '0%',\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: '.brand-reveal',\n                    start: \"top 95%\",\n                }\n            });\n\n            gsap.to('.brand-year', {\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                delay: 0.4,\n                ease: \"power2.out\",\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: '.brand-reveal',\n                    start: \"top 95%\",\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 3. Canvas \"WebGL\" Particle Network\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('canvas-particles');\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let particles = [];\n\n            function resizeCanvas() {\n                canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            }\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);\n            resizeCanvas();\n\n            class Particle {\n                constructor() {\n                    this.x = Math.random() * canvas.width;\n                    this.y = Math.random() * canvas.height;\n                    this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.6;\n                    this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.6;\n                    this.radius = Math.random() * 1.8 + 0.5;\n                }\n                update() {\n                    this.x += this.vx;\n                    this.y += this.vy;\n                    if (this.x < 0 || this.x > canvas.width) this.vx = -this.vx;\n                    if (this.y < 0 || this.y > canvas.height) this.vy = -this.vy;\n                }\n                draw() {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fillStyle = '#ffffff';\n                    ctx.fill();\n                }\n            }\n\n            const particleCount = Math.floor((window.innerWidth * window.innerHeight) / 22000);\n            for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n                particles.push(new Particle());\n            }\n\n            function animateCanvas() {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n\n                for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\n                    particles[i].update();\n                    particles[i].draw();\n\n                    for (let j = i; j < particles.length; j++) {\n                        const dx = particles[i].x - particles[j].x;\n                        const dy = particles[i].y - particles[j].y;\n                        const distance = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                        if (distance < 130) {\n                            ctx.beginPath();\n                            ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${0.25 - distance/520})`;\n                            ctx.lineWidth = 0.6;\n                            ctx.moveTo(particles[i].x, particles[i].y);\n                            ctx.lineTo(particles[j].x, particles[j].y);\n                            ctx.stroke();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n            }\n            animateCanvas();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aura-connect-interface-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aura-connect-interface-1.jpg", "source_name": "aura-connect-interface-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 53, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T15:45:01.687993+00:00"}